  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJefta waseGileyadi wayeliqhawe elilamandla, wayeyindodana yewule, uyise wayenguGileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UmkaGileyadi wamzalela amanye amadodana; kwathi lawomadodana esekhulile amxotsha uJefta, athi kuye: Kawuyikudla ilifa endlini kababa, ngoba uyindodana yomunye umfazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJefta wabaleka kubafowabo, wayahlala elizweni laseTobi. Abantu abagangileyo babuthana kuye, bamlandela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emva kwesikhathi amaAmoni alwa loIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ekulweni kwawo loIsrayeli abadala baseGileyadi bahamba bayathatha uJefta elizweni laseTobi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bathi kuye: Woza ube ngumholi wethu ukuba silwe lamaAmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa yena wathi kibo: Kalingizondanga yini, langixotsha endlini kababa na? Pho, lizelani kimi nxa selihlupheka na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bona bathi kuye: Yikho lokhu okusenze seza kuwe khathesi ukuba uhambe lathi siyekulwa lamaAmoni, ube yinduna yabo bonke abaseGileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJefta wathi kibo: Uba lingibuyisa ekhaya ukulwa lamaAmoni, iNkosi iwanikele kimi, ngizakuba yinhloko yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abadala baseGileyadi bathi kuye: INkosi izakuba ngufakazi phakathi kwethu; impela sizakwenza lokhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJefta wasehamba labo, abantu bamenza waba yinhloko yabo lomholi wabo. EMizipa uJefta wabuya wakhuluma zonke izimiso zakhe phambi kweNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJefta wasethumela izithunywa enkosini yamaAmoni esithi: Ungibangisani ukuba uphume uzekulwa lelizwe lami na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yamaAmoni yaziphendula izithunywa zikaJefta yathi: Ngoba uIsrayeli wathatha ilizwe lami ekuphumeni kwakhe eGibithe kusukela eArinoni kusiya eJaboki laseJordani; ngakhoke libuyiseni ngokuthula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJefta wasethuma izithunywa futhi enkosini yamaAmoni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "esithi: UJefta uthi uIsrayeli kalithathanga ilizwe laseMowabi lelamaAmoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodwa ekuphumeni kwakhe eGibithe uIsrayeli wadabula enkangala waya oLwandle oluBomvu, wafika eKadeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsrayeli wasethumela izithunywa enkosini yaseEdoma esithi: Akusivumele sidlule elizweni lakho; kodwa inkosi yaseEdoma kayaze yakulalela lokho. Basebethumela izithunywa enkosini yaseMowabi, layo kayivumanga. Ngakho abakoIsrayeli bahlala eKadeshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.20.14+NUM.20.15+NUM.20.16+NUM.20.17+NUM.20.18+NUM.20.19+NUM.20.20+NUM.20.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 20:14–21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebedabula enkangala, balibhoda ilizwe laseEdoma lelaseMowabi, bafika ngasempumalanga kwelizwe laseMowabi. Bahlala ngaphetsheya kweArinoni, kodwa kabangenanga elizweni laseMowabi ngoba iArinoni lalingumngcele waseMowabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 21:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoIsrayeli basebethuma izithunywa kuSihoni inkosi yamaAmori, inkosi yaseHeshiboni, bathi: Ake usivumele sedlule elizweni lakho siye kwelakithi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 21:21–24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uSihoni kamvumelanga uIsrayeli ukuba adlule elizweni lakhe; wasebutha bonke abantu bakhe, wamisa eJahazi, walwa loIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa iNkosi, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, yamnikela uSihoni labo bonke abantu bakhe esandleni sikaIsrayeli, babahlula. Ngakho abakoIsrayeli balithatha lonke ilizwe lamaAmori ayehlala kulelolizwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balithatha lonke ilizwe lamaAmori kusukela eArinoni kusiya eJaboki, kusukela enkangala kusiya eJordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokhoke iNkosi, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, yawaxotsha amaAmori phambi kwabantu bayo uIsrayeli. Wena uzakusithathela ilizwe na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kawuyikuthatha lokhu uKemoshi unkulunkulu wakho akunika khona na? Konke lokho iNkosi uNkulunkulu wethu eyakuthathela abanye kungokwethu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenake ungcono yini kuloBalaki indodana kaZipori inkosi yaseMowabi na? Yena wake waxabana yini loIsrayeli na? Wake walwa labo na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.22.1+NUM.22.2+NUM.22.3+NUM.22.4+NUM.22.5+NUM.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 22:1–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho uIsrayeli esehlala eHeshiboni lasemizini yalo, laseAroweri lasemizini yalo, lakuyo yonke imizi esokhunjini lweArinoni iminyaka engamakhulu amathathu, kungani ungalithathanga lelolizwe kulesosikhathi na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke mina kangilonanga ngalutho, uyangona wena ngokulwa lami; iNkosi uMahluleli izakwahlulela yona phakathi kwabakoIsrayeli lamaAmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa inkosi yamaAmoni kayiwalalelanga lamazwi kaJefta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMoya weNkosi wasumehlela uJefta, wadabula iGileyadi lakoManase, wadlulela eMizipa laseGileyadi; wasuka lapho wadlulela kumaAmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJefta wafunga eNkosini wathi: Uba unikela amaAmoni esandleni sami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuzakuthi loba yikuphi okuphuma endlini yami ukungihlangabeza ekubuyeni kwami senginqobile amaAmoni, kuzakuba ngokweNkosi, ngizakukunikela kube ngumnikelo wokutshiswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uJefta wasecaphela kumaAmoni ukulwa lawo; iNkosi yawanikela esandleni sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wawachitha kusukela eAroweri kwaze kwaba seduze leMinithi, wathatha imizi engamatshumi amabili, waze wayafika eAbeli‐Keramimi, wawabulala wawaqothula. UIsrayeli wawanqoba ngokunjalo amaAmoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJefta wayafika emzini wakhe eMizipa. Kwaphuma indodakazi yakhe ukumhlangabeza, itshaya ichacho igida; yayinguye yedwa umntanakhe; ngaphandle kwayo wayengelandodana lendodakazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho eyibona wadabula izigqoko zakhe wathi: Maye mntanami! ungidabule inhliziyo, wangilethela ukuhlupheka okukhulu, ngoba ngifungile eNkosini, ngingeke ngisaphule isifungo sami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.30.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 30:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yona yathi kuye: Baba, uba ufungile eNkosini, yenza kimi njengokufunga kwakho, lokhu iNkosi isikuphindisele ezitheni zakho amaAmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngicela ungenzele lokhu ukuthi ungiyekele inyanga ezimbili ngizule ezintabeni, ngikhalele ubuntombi bami mina labangane bami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wathi: Hamba. Waseyiyekela ihamba okwenyanga ezimbili. Yasihambake, yona labangane bayo, yakhalela ubuntombi bayo ezintabeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekupheleni kwenyanga ezimbili yabuyela kuyise owenza kuyo njengokufunga kwakhe. Yayingazanga ihlangane lendoda. Kwaba ngumkhubo koIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukuba amadodakazi akoIsrayeli ahambe yonke iminyaka ukukhalela indodakazi kaJefta owaseGileyadi insuku ezine ngomnyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
